ents{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T14:23:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T14:23:59Z","body":"It looks like the build config for xatlas always excluded android and iOS ever since the module was created. This was done before we had an Android editor. It likely should have been changed when we created the Android editor, the fact that it wasn't seems like an oversight to me. \n\nIts clear from the git history that nobody has intentionally disabled xatlas_unwrap on the Android editor","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2980590134/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2980641966","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107398#issuecomment-2980641966","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107398","id":2980641966,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xqPyu","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T14:37:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T14:37:04Z","body":"> Its clear from the git history that nobody has intentionally disabled xatlas_unwrap on the Android editor\n\nActually the first commit adding xatlas_unwrap had a lot of platform specific code: 6cbdeedf57c7383827416da19b6026e3721f2812\n\nAnd didn't include platform specific code for Android, so the extra guard in `config.py` made sense in case we'd eventually implement support for the editor on Android (and iOS).\n\nBut I removed all this platform-specific code in eb155bc91abb4bdb293290fd4bc5ade12bc79669 as it was unnecessary. So indeed now the Android and iOS exclusion in `config.py` could be removed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2980641966/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2980701333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107398#issuecomment-2980701333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107398","id":2980701333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xqeSV","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"